NOTE [F78, 2026-09-01]: an earlier run of this probe reported 232 of 282 rows
carrying a continuation block, up to 11 lines.  That was WRONG and the wrongness
is instructive: the block ran to the next numbered row, so every BLANK SEPARATOR
